# Fusion docs content

Before adding or changing documentation or UI copy:

1. Read and follow `.agents/skills/fusion-docs/SKILL.md` (same skill at `.cursor/skills/fusion-docs/`).
2. Apply the same MDX / `meta.json` change under `content/docs/en`, `content/docs/fa`, and `content/docs/ru`.
3. Keep `meta.json` `pages` lists identical across those locales.
4. Update `content/locales/{en,fa,ru}/` together when changing UI strings.
5. Do not invent APIs or package names — verify against `fusion-framework` and `fusion-tool`. Use `fusion-framework` (PyPI/npm), NuGet `Fusion-Framework`, import `fusion_framework` / `FusionFramework`.
6. Include `v1` in product doc links.
